it was running v5.1.0 (this morning's deploy) in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate.\n- **Rollback:** the release history only has two versions. v5.0.0 was healthy in production and v5.1.0 was degraded. I rolled `payments-api` back to v5.0.0 in all three regions. It now reports healthy, with a 0.2% error rate (down from 18%). No approval was needed, because v5.0.0 has been healthy in production before.\n- **Incident:** I opened INC-0001 (SEV2, `payments-api`), which paged on-call. It describes the v5.1.0 problem and the rollback, and lists finding the root cause in v5.1.0 as the next step.\n\nI can't list every service, so if there's another payments service I didn't try, I couldn't check it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01LXSmXUQhuBd6bT6AYWLbkm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01YFSrQboNFdQCWdqhjMhExb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_014aoDeMVqfu9gLYEwqB9Q7e", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01JTStKfArp78VrvAcMaCBcR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_016SQyWVjCexSANq1Eb699n9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01XunZZ7Tq6L8ezSz2aHXr6D", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"