 the release history only has two versions. v5.0.0 was healthy in production and v5.1.0 was degraded. I rolled `payments-api` back to v5.0.0 in all three regions. It now reports healthy, with a 0.2% error rate (down from 18%). No approval was needed, because v5.0.0 has been healthy in production before.\n- **Incident:** I opened INC-0001 (SEV2, `payments-api`), which paged on-call. It describes the v5.1.0 problem and the rollback, and lists finding the root cause in v5.1.0 as the next step.\n\nI can't list every service, so if there's another payments service I didn't try, I couldn't check it.", "type": "text"}]}]}